# Code of Conduct

## Our Commitment
We are committed to providing a welcoming and inclusive environment for all contributors.

## Expected Behavior
- Use welcoming and inclusive language
- Be respectful of differing opinions, viewpoints, and experiences
- Gracefully accept constructive criticism
- Focus on what is best for the community
- Show empathy towards other community members

## Unacceptable Behavior
- Harassment, intimidation, or discrimination
- Offensive comments related to gender, sexual orientation, disability, mental illness, or socioeconomic status
- Deliberate intimidation or threats
- Stalking or unwanted contact
- Any form of abuse

## Enforcement
Project maintainers are responsible for enforcing this Code of Conduct.

## Reporting Issues
Report unacceptable behavior to: [your-email@example.com]

